# Guard against accidental ingestion of secrets and protected material.
# This is a defense-in-depth aid, NOT the primary control. The primary control is
# authoring discipline (see GOVERNANCE.md §Protected Information). Nothing below should
# be read as permission to place protected material anywhere in this repository.

# Keys and key material
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*.pfx
*.p12
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.asc
*.gpg
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
*_ed25519
*_rsa
*private*key*
*deploy*key*

# Credentials / secrets / environment values
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets.*
credentials
credentials.*
*.credentials
.netrc
*.pgpass

# Infrastructure state (may embed secrets)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars

# Cloud / provider credential files
.aws/
.azure/
*azure*credential*
*gcloud*credential*

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
